      "summary": "Purely decorative fixed background layer that paints four blurred pastel blobs and a masked dot grid behind all page content, with separate opacities for light and dark mode.",
      "tags": ["component", "presentational", "background", "styling", "animation"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "A server component by default (no \"use client\"), since it holds no state and renders only static markup."
    },
